  "title": "Kopin Corporation to Host Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Call on Monday, August 10, 2026 at 5:00 PM Eastern Time",
  "summary": "WESTBOROUGH, Mass. – Kopin Corporation (Nasdaq: KOPN) (“Kopin” or the “Company”), a leading provider of application-specific optical systems and high-performance microdisplays for defense, AI-infrastructure, enterprise, industrial, consumer and medical products, today announced it will release select unaudited financial results for the second quarter ended June 27, 2026 after market close on Monday, August 10, 2026. […]",
